        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nResidential Site at Dangan, Kilmacow, Co. Kilkenny\n\nc. 0.89 Acre Site | Full Planning Permission | No Local Needs Restriction\n\nDNG Reid & Coppinger are delighted to present this attractive c. 0.89 acre residential site situated at Dangan, within the village of Kilmacow, Co. Kilkenny. The site occupies a pleasant position within an established residential area characterised predominantly by quality detached homes, while enjoying an attractive outlook over the surrounding countryside.\n\nA particularly important feature of the property is the benefit of full unrestricted planning permission, with no local area need or occupancy restriction, for an impressive architect-designed detached two-storey residence extending to approximately 2,500 sq.ft. (232 sq.m.). Planning permission was originally granted in 2017 and subsequently extended in 2022 under Planning Reference 22/115, with the permission remaining valid until 2nd February 2028. \n\nThe proposed dwelling has been thoughtfully designed to provide generous contemporary family accommodation and represents an excellent opportunity for a purchaser wishing to construct a substantial family home, with the considerable advantage of a current planning permission already in place. The site enjoys extensive road frontage and all mains services are available, making this an exceptionally convenient opportunity for those looking to undertake a self-build project in an established village setting.\n\nKilmacow is a popular and well-established South Kilkenny village with a strong community and an excellent range of everyday amenities. These include primary schooling, local shops and services, a community centre and extensive sporting and recreational facilities. Kilmacow Sports Complex provides GAA, soccer, athletics and tennis facilities together with a children's playground, while the River Blackwater and surrounding countryside provide attractive opportunities for walking and outdoor recreation. \n\nThe location combines the benefits of village living with excellent accessibility to Waterford City. Kilmacow is approximately 9.5 km from Waterford City, making the site particularly convenient for those working in the city while wishing to enjoy a more relaxed village environment. The M9 Motorway is readily accessible, providing excellent connectivity towards Kilkenny City, Dublin and the wider national road network, while Waterford and the wider South-East are also easily reached. \n\nFeatures:\n• Attractive residential site extending to c. 0.89 acres \n• Full planning permission already granted \n• No local area need / occupancy restriction \n• Permission for architect-designed detached residence of c. 2,500 sq.ft. / 232 sq.m. \n• Located within Kilmacow Village \n• Established residential setting with predominantly detached one-off homes \n• Extensive road frontage \n• All mains services available \n• Approximately 9.5 km from Waterford City \n• Convenient access to the M9 Motorway, Kilkenny City and the wider South East \n• Excellent local schools, sporting facilities and village amenities \n• An ideal opportunity to build a substantial family home in a highly convenient location"
      },
      {
